  "description": "This pull request enhances the Alembic migration to support multiple database backends (PostgreSQL, SQLite, and MySQL) by dynamically handling constraint naming and accommodating database-specific behaviors such as type casting and constraint renaming. Both the upgrade and downgrade paths have been improved to ensure safer and more robust migrations across all supported databas",
